# SwaggerContractTests and SuccessMessageContractTests compare these files byte for byte with what the host
# produces, so git must never rewrite their line endings on checkout (core.autocrlf=true would turn every LF
# into CRLF and fail the test on a fresh worktree). -text disables the conversion and keeps the files diffable
# as text.
swagger.v1.json -text
success-messages.v1.txt -text
